      "created_at": "2026-02-26T08:50:01.045Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The surcharge ( SWC) is supposed to be calculated only on Basic Custom duty ,</p>\n<p>The flow of Taxes is as follow - BCD = Assessable Value × BCD Rate, SWS = BCD × 10%, IGST Value = Assessable Value + BCD + SWS</p>\n<p>Issues</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>If we manually add surcharge in Tax child Table - IGST Calculation is incorrect (This isssue is already raised in Git Hub , have taken screeshot from there)</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e_2_690x170.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"o1pCKKPFHqVbPXRUZexzGNM4arc\" width=\"690\" height=\"170\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e_2_690x170.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e_2_1035x255.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a85d12eec7449178a5fad5565aa671e42ed8cb7e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1276×316 21.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If we Use Item Tax Template  in Purchase Invoice to book the Surcharge , the calculation of surcharge is incorrect , suchareg is getting calculated on Assessable value rather than BCD.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/b/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7_2_624x159.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xEgWTmLm2lcVPOePly3l8xNtaC3\" width=\"624\" height=\"159\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7_2_624x159.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7_2_936x238.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/ebd52f120241e8eebfc911ac1667cc5fdd3a22e7_2_1248x318.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2048×520 54.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
